hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"986","Ishaq bin Mansour told us, Abd al-Samad told us, Hammam told us, Qatada told us, on the authority of An-Nadr bin Anas, on the authority of Bashir bin Nahik On the authority of Abu Hurairah, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Whoever prays one rak’ah in the morning, then the sun rises, let him pray another rak’ah.”"
